174
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:18,040
Well, I keep underwear on.

175
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:19,940
Is that not normal?

176
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:21,220
Oh, man.

177
00:08:23,540 --> 00:08:26,040
Come to think of it, he isn't shy about undressing.

178
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,820
Wait, am I supposed to get embarrassed when he strips in front of me?

179
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:34,200
Well, now just thinking about it makes me feel embarrassed.

180
00:08:34,660 --> 00:08:35,820
Hey, random.

181
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:37,440
But can I see your tattoos, please?

182
00:08:38,900 --> 00:08:39,580
Of course.

183
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:40,920
Seriously?

184
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:44,920
All a girl has to do is ask and you'll start stripping?

185
00:08:45,180 --> 00:08:46,980
You didn't even question my motives.

186
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:47,960
Come on!

187
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:50,780
Well, I questioned it when you said please, though.

188
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:53,980
Are you like an exhibitionist or what?

189
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:57,700
Hey, I only felt comfortable because you've seen them before.

190
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,160
What if Toru asked?

191
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:02,560
Well, sure, I'd be fine with that, too.

192
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:05,040
I showed him my tats one of the first days we talked.

193
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:07,800
What if the tables were turned and he buried it all in front of you?

194
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:10,360
Well, that really depends on the situation.

195
00:09:10,660 --> 00:09:11,400
