202
00:09:24,060 --> 00:09:25,760
In a beat-around-the-bush sort of way.

203
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:29,680
Because, like, it seems I'm constantly acting like a spaz, whereas you always play it cool,

204
00:09:29,780 --> 00:09:32,520
and I can count the number of times I've seen you blush on one hand!

205
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:32,680
And...

206
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:35,060
While I blush really easily.

207
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,660
Uh-huh.

208
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:39,020
Great!

209
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,700
He's totally creeped out by me!

210
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:41,740
Uh...

211
00:09:41,740 --> 00:09:44,660
So then you were testing me to see if I'd get embarrassed.

212
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,340
Mm.

213
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:48,340
I'd be up to do a retest if you want!

214
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,540
What's the point?

215
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,380
It's useless if you know about it!

216
00:09:51,420 --> 00:09:52,660
I mean, it is hot.

217
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:54,260
Going shirtless would feel better.

218
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:55,720
You failed the retest, too!

219
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:56,380
All right.

220
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,220
